{% doc %}
  Biotaderm — per-line pump offer.

  Any pump fits any bottle, so the cart cannot know whether a customer needs one:
  that depends on what they already own. This is therefore an OFFER on every
  refill line, never a warning, and never suppressed by what another line holds.

  It replaced a single cart-wide button that had three faults. It was hidden
  whenever any pump was anywhere in the cart, so a cart holding one pump and two
  refills said nothing at all. It swapped every refill line at once, with no way
  to choose per product. And it advertised "+£1.00" while charging £1.00 per
  unit, so swapping two refills cost £2.00.

  One click converts ONE unit, so the price on the control is always the true
  price of the click. A refill line of two becomes one with-pump and one refill,
  and the remaining refill still carries the offer.

  @param {object} item - the cart line item
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign bd_pump = nil
  if item.variant.title contains 'Refill'
    # Match the variant that differs only in the package-type option. Every product
    # currently carries one option with two values, but matching on the value rather
    # than on position survives a product that later gains a second option.
    for v in item.product.variants
      if v.title contains 'Pump' and v.available
        assign bd_pump = v
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}

{%- if bd_pump -%}
  {%- assign bd_delta = bd_pump.price | minus: item.variant.price -%}
  <button
    type="button"
    class="bd-line-pump"
    data-bd-add-pump
    data-refill-id="{{ item.variant.id }}"
    data-pump-id="{{ bd_pump.id }}"
  >
    Needs a pump? Add one
    {%- if bd_delta > 0 %} · +{{ bd_delta | money }}{% endif -%}
  </button>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .bd-line-pump {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-block-start: 6px;
    padding: 0;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: var(--font-size--xs, 0.8125rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #3d6a75;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .bd-line-pump:hover {
    color: #f47d5e;
  }

  .bd-line-pump[aria-busy='true'] {
    opacity: 0.55;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
